    "identifier": "psionics-insinuation",
    "description": "<p>You unleash a torrent of conflicting desires into the mind of one creature you can see within range, impairing its ability to make decisions. The target must make an Intelligence saving throw</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creature takes 1d12 Psychic damage.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creature takes 2d12 psychic damage and makes their chakra control check to maintain concentration at disadvantage.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Affected creatures takes 4d12 psychic damage and loses concentration on a jutsu with the lowest cost they are currently concentrating on.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d12. If this jutsu is cast at C-Rank or higher, if the affected creature would cast a Jutsu on their following turn, they retake the same damage originally dealt by this jutsu. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the number of creatures you can target by +1.</p>",
